{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A DEMO IS AVAILABLE!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pardon My French Toast is a 3D platformer featuring a toast who can spread sweets on is face to get funny abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/PMFT_Intro2.gif?t=1747038304\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Let's get sugary!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about a <strong>dozen abilities</strong>, each more amazing than the last!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spread honey on your face\u00a0</strong>to\u00a0stick to things and climb walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use hardened chocolate</strong> to break stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Much more to discover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/PMFT_Honey.gif?t=1747038304\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A piece of cake?!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Jam Session's Cruise!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore dozens of levels to find the big candies that fuel the boat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet some friendly toasts along the way and help them achieve their different goals.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A ton of collectibles to find. Are you in?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/PMFT_Chocolate.gif?t=1747038304\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3407360?t=1747038304","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/00af09029dd187d014b491aca913122bcace98a0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747038304","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.